          "type": "START"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "End of data pipeline",
            "name": "End"
          },
          "outcomes": {},
          "code": "END",
          "id": "end",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "END"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Name Identifier"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1772621239725"
          },
          "code": "NAME_IDENTIFIER",
          "id": "1763113186690",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1763113186692_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an agent that takes a user query and from the query you have to identify the name of user. \nTake this as input {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nExample - \n1. Input - Check if there are any pending transactions for Anusha.\n    Output - {\"userName\": \"Anusha\"}\n2. Input - Check if there are any pending transactions for Veda Moss .\n   Output - {\"userName\": \"Veda Moss\"}\n\nIf user name is not available then return \"NONE\" as user name."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"title\": \"UserNameResponse\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"userName\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"userName\"]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "AssignPersonNamePresentOrNot"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1772621329016"
          },
          "code": "ASSIGNPERSONNAMEPRESENTORNOT",
          "id": "1772621239725",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772621242899",
              "name": "checkPersonName",
              "type": "boolean",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.NAME_IDENTIFIER.$output.userName == \"NONE\" }}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "SET_FIELDS"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "CheckIfNameIsGivenByUser"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "true": "1772621571927",
            "false": "1763113949249"
          },
          "code": "CHECKIFNAMEISGIVENBYUSER",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1772621329016",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772621329017_1",
              "name": "condition",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$variables.checkPersonName}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "CONDITION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_HCM_GLOBALHUMA_WORKERASSIGNMENTOBJECT",
            "functionName": "get_worker_data_by_name",
            "name": "Worker Assignment Tool"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1763380277461"
          },
          "code": "WORKER_ASSIGNMENT_TOOL",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1772621375167",
          "id": "1763113949249",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1763114001234_1",
              "name": "workerName",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.NAME_IDENTIFIER.$output.userName}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{}",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Format Output"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "FORMAT_OUTPUT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1772621375167",
          "id": "1763380277461",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1763380277462_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Take this response as input {{$context.$nodes.WORKER_ASSIGNMENT_TOOL.$output}}\n\nUse following instructions to format the provided input - \n**Scenario - 1** : *When the Worker Assignment Tool returns no records*\nIf the user is requesting to find assignment details for a particular Worker by giving the DisplayName\n    - Display a message that no person record exists matching the {DisplayName}.\n\n**Scenario - 2** : *When the Worker Assignment Tool returns multiple records*\n\n        **Show the response in an HTML Table format as below:** \n        -  Convert the following markdown-style table into an HTML table with proper <table>, <thead>, <tbody>, <tr>, <th>, and <td> tags. Include styling with border-collapse and some padding for readability.\n        - First, do slot filling and don't use the table as-is; fill with actual data from tools, and then only convert to an HTML table.\n\n        Display name            | Assignment Id        | Person number        | Business title    |\n        ------------------------|--------------------------|----------------------|--------------------|\n        <Display name>          | <Assignment id 1>    | <Person number 1>    | <Business title 1> | \n        <Display name>          | <Assignment id 1>    | <Person number 1>    | <Business title 1> |"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Display Name Request"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "DISPLAY_NAME_REQUEST",
          "id": "1772621571927",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772621571929_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Display a message - Please provide objectId."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "Do not give any extra information apart from  Please provide objectId.  The ouput should be just that one line.\nDo not use any quotes in the response",
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
      "rootNode": "start",
